<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling strengthens on dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling strengthens on dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzania shilling strengthened against the dollar and the pound on Monday, furthering two weeks of gains on the dollar, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 593.9505 compared to Friday's 593.9703, while the pound exchanged at 996.6213 compared to 1,001.5251, the central bank said.</p>
</text>
